1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,850
What was 'sweet as honey' and why?
什么东西“像蜜一样甜”，为什么？

2
00:00:13,850 --> 00:00:17,940
What was 'sweet as honey' and why?
什么东西“像蜜一样甜”，为什么？

3
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:26,530
In 1963 a Lancaster bomber crashed on Wallis Island,
1963年，一架兰开斯特轰炸机在瓦利斯岛坠毁，

4
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:32,790
a remote place in the South Pacific, a long way west of Samoa.
那是南太平洋上一个偏僻的地方，位于萨摩亚群岛以西很远。

5
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:36,710
The plane wasn't too badly damaged,
飞机损坏得并不太厉害，

6
00:00:36,730 --> 00:00:42,490
but over the years the crash was forgotten and the wreck remained undisturbed.
但多年来这次坠机被人遗忘，残骸一直没有人动过。

7
00:00:43,830 --> 00:00:49,860
Then in 1989, twenty-six years after the crash,
后来到了1989年，也就是坠机26年后，

8
00:00:50,450 --> 00:00:55,940
the plane was accidentally rediscovered in an aerial survey of the island.
在对这个岛进行航空测量时偶然重新发现了这架飞机。

9
00:00:57,120 --> 00:00:58,590
By this time,
到这个时候，

10
00:00:58,610 --> 00:01:04,310
a Lancaster bomber in reasonable condition was rare and worth rescuing.
状况尚好的兰开斯特轰炸机已很罕见，值得拯救。

11
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:12,150
The French authorities had the plane packaged and moved in parts back to France.
法国当局把飞机包装起来，拆成部件运回法国。

12
00:01:13,180 --> 00:01:17,670
Now a group of enthusiasts are going to have the plane restored.
现在一批爱好者准备把飞机修复。

13
00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:25,990
It has four Rolls-Royce Merlin engines but the group will need to have only three of them rebuilt.
飞机有四台罗尔斯·罗伊斯“梅林”发动机，但他们只需要修复其中三台。

14
00:01:27,260 --> 00:01:33,590
Imagine their surprise and delight when they broke open the packing cases
想象一下他们撬开包装箱时惊喜的心情，

15
00:01:33,610 --> 00:01:41,390
and found that the fourth engine was sweet as honey--still in perfect condition.
他们发现第四台发动机像蜜一样甜——仍处于完好状态。

16
00:01:42,520 --> 00:01:52,040
A colony of bees had turned the engine into a hive and it was totally preserved in beeswax!
一群蜜蜂把发动机变成了蜂巢，它被蜂蜡完整地保存了下来！
